 owner, providing a handle."}, {"name": "Unlock", "description": "Unlocks a previously locked application."}, {"name": "Reason", "description": "Returns reason for locking."}, {"name": "Owner", "description": "Returns lock owner information."}, {"name": "GetLockInfo", "description": "Gets detailed lock info for an application."}], "calls": ["Core::IUnknown", "ILISA::IStorage::Path", "ILISA::IStorage::QuotaKB", "ILISA::IStorage::UsedKB", "ILISA::IStoragePayload::Apps", "ILISA::IStoragePayload::Persistent", "ILISA::IKeyValueIterator::Reset", "ILISA::IKeyValueIterator::IsValid", "ILISA::IKeyValueIterator::Next", "ILISA::IKeyValueIterator::Current", "ILISA::IMetadataPayload::AppName", "ILISA::IMetadataPayload::Category", "ILISA::IMetadataPayload::Url", "ILISA::IMetadataPayload::Resources", "ILISA::IMetadataPayload::AuxMetadata", "ILISA::IAppVersion::Version", "ILISA::IAppVersion::AppName", "ILISA::IAppVersion::Category", "ILISA::IAppVersion::Url", "ILISA::IApp::Type", "ILISA::IApp::Id", "ILISA::IApp::Installed", "ILISA::IApp::Current", "ILISA::IAppsPayload::Apps", "ILISA::IHandleResult::Handle", "ILISA::ILockInfo::Reason", "ILISA::ILockInfo::Owner"], "search-terms": ["ILISA", "Application Management", "Storage Interface", "Metadata Management", "Locking Mechanism", "Application Lifecycle", "WPEFramework"], "state": 2, "file_id": 73, "knowledge_revision": 636, "git_revision": "2436f6afbbac3e771366e6cf6fae0434868d734d", "ctags": [{"_type": "tag", "name": "Exchange", "path": "/home/kavia/workspace/code-generation/entservices-apis-34/apis/LISA/ILISA.h", "pattern": "/^namespace Exchange {$/", "language": "C++", "kind": "namespace", "scope": "WPEFramework", "scopeKind": "namespace"}, {"_type": "tag", "name": "IApp", "path": "/home/kavia/workspace/code-generation/entservices-apis-34/apis/LISA/ILISA.h", "pattern": "/^        struct EXTERNAL IApp : virtual public Core::IUnknown {$/", "language": "C++", "kind": "struct", "scope": "WPEFramework::Exchange::ILISA", "scopeKind": "str